{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE NEW WUKONG'S JOURNEY CAMPAIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when you thought the Kingdom was safe\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three ruthless demons escaped their ancient prisons and stole the orbs that gave the Sun Wukong his legendary power. If they unlock their secrets, the entire kingdom could fall into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good thing the Alliance knows a thing or two about world-ending threats! Together, they must chase the demons across perilous islands and restore balance before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/extras/599bcb1e7533fc06429e3fffd9e0fcae.poster.avif?t=1755778530\" width=620 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/extras/599bcb1e7533fc06429e3fffd9e0fcae.webm?t=1755778530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/extras/599bcb1e7533fc06429e3fffd9e0fcae.mp4?t=1755778530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THREE DEMONS ON THE LOOSE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through 5 epic stages across mystical islands steeped in elemental magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 18 fierce New Enemies, including blazing beasts, storm elementals, ironclad warriors, and other mythical creatures.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront three dreaded demon bosses: Red Boy, Princess Iron Fan, and the Bull Demon King, each more dangerous than the last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/extras/9ccad3e7f6f7f41db71c3267b598cee7.poster.avif?t=1755778530\" width=620 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/extras/9ccad3e7f6f7f41db71c3267b598cee7.webm?t=1755778530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/extras/9ccad3e7f6f7f41db71c3267b598cee7.mp4?t=1755778530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LEGENDS JOIN YOUR SIDE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New hero: More than just a trickster, the legendary Sun Wukong is a formidable warrior, even with his power scattered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New tower: Bamboo Masters shred through enemies with martial skill, elemental magic, and sheer awesomeness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/extras/83cf2fae3aa3f210834542f25f494fb6.poster.avif?t=1755778530\" width=620 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/extras/83cf2fae3aa3f210834542f25f494fb6.webm?t=1755778530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/extras/83cf2fae3aa3f210834542f25f494fb6.mp4?t=1755778530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DLC FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Dangerous New Stages across ancient mystical islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 Deadly New Enemies: from mythical creatures to iron-clad warriors\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Demon Bosses: Red Boy, Princess Iron Fan, and the Bull Demon King</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 New Hero: The legendary Monkey King, Sun Wukong, joins the Alliance!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 New Tower: this panda trio will skadoosh your way to victory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Mechanic: Harness the power of the elements with Elemental Holders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 New Achievements to conquer (and brag about)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easter eggs packed with ancient surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732970?t=1755778530","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/c8d5971b819b3e66df9b7ee2c110cc7390fbaf89/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755778530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/3461ffd04232041e5f5a972852ee0ee2d8f33717/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755778530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732970/3461ffd04232041e5f5a972852ee0ee2d8f33717/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755778530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE NEW WUKONG'S JOURNEY CAMPAIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when you thought the Kingdom was safe\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three ruthless demons escaped their ancient prisons and stole the orbs that gave the Sun Wukong his legendary power. If they unlock their secrets, the entire kingdom could fall into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good thing the Alliance knows a thing or two ab